(7657846, 1247016, 61679, '<td valign="top">Back to comment.  To capture a picture of a bear in your backyard is amazing.  Two suggestions you can try that might improve this image.  <br/> <br/>First, you could try adding a bit more contrast.  The bright sunlight is washing out the colors a little bit.  <br/> <br/>Second, you could change the crop to an 8x10 portrait.  This would move the bear off center and to the left while still giving it room on the right to show where he is looking towards.</td>', 'Back to comment.  To capture a picture of a bear in your backyard is amazing.  Two suggestions you can try that might improve this image.   First, you could try adding a bit more contrast.  The bright sunlight is washing out the colors a little bit.   Second, you could change the crop to an 8x10 portrait.  This would move the bear off center and to the left while still giving it room on the right to show where he is looking towards.', '2020-04-08 13:15:17.000000', NULL, 1),
