(7658634, 1247543, 167587, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by willem:</b></div><hr/><i> These are usually very slow moving and offer plenty of opportunity for a good picture. Maybe should have waited for a better moment? </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thanks for your comment. Perhaps the image didn''t translate well with the current Animal Challenge. For me, the photo represents an evolutionary transition for the Orangutan. He''s not simply an "animal." He is displaying an action of "consciousness"<br/>and awareness by peering into his hand... in very human way. I wasn''t looking for a better moment, as I thought that this one was priceless. <br/> <br/>BTW, as an exhibition piece, I''ve sold at least a handful (no pun intended) of these prints. Nonetheless, I am always appreciative of comments as well as how other people see their photographic work. Best regards and thanks again.</td>', 'Originally posted by willem: These are usually very slow moving and offer plenty of opportunity for a good picture. Maybe should have waited for a better moment?   Thanks for your comment. Perhaps the image didn''t translate well with the current Animal Challenge. For me, the photo represents an evolutionary transition for the Orangutan. He''s not simply an "animal." He is displaying an action of "consciousness"and awareness by peering into his hand... in very human way. I wasn''t looking for a better moment, as I thought that this one was priceless.  BTW, as an exhibition piece, I''ve sold at least a handful (no pun intended) of these prints. Nonetheless, I am always appreciative of comments as well as how other people see their photographic work. Best regards and thanks again.', '2020-04-15 13:34:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7658635, 1247512, 16912, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the HM Lydia, I couldn''t be hoppier for you (sorry) even though you are now officially <a href="https://dpcribbons.hajeka.com/browser.html" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">unoffically</a> above me ;)<br/> <br/></td>', 'Congrats on the HM Lydia, I couldn''t be hoppier for you (sorry) even though you are now officially unoffically above me ;) ', '2020-04-15 13:54:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7658636, 1247350, 156041, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Bear_Music:</b></div><hr/><i> Beat me by 3 slots :-) </i></td></tr></table>At least we don''t have to worry about uploading our original photo. Stay safe.</td>', 'Originally posted by Bear_Music: Beat me by 3 slots :-) At least we don''t have to worry about uploading our original photo. Stay safe.', '2020-04-15 14:09:21.000000', NULL, 0),
