(7658700, 1247026, 135744, '<td valign="top">I instantly recognised these as UK sheep - they must have a certain look. I love it! Very nicely captured and this most definitely has the cute factor.</td>', 'I instantly recognised these as UK sheep - they must have a certain look. I love it! Very nicely captured and this most definitely has the cute factor.', '2020-04-16 10:11:26.000000', NULL, 0),
(7658701, 1247496, 135744, '<td valign="top">Now that is one dog I won''t forget. I love the central composition and the DOF is perfect and the exposure is superb, not to mention the dogs walking skills</td>', 'Now that is one dog I won''t forget. I love the central composition and the DOF is perfect and the exposure is superb, not to mention the dogs walking skills', '2020-04-16 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 0),
